With the USPD's help, the Zentrale proposes negotiations. Many fighters refuse to leave the buildings.

- @hunt: Continue...

@hunt
title: The Freikorps Enter Berlin
new-page: true

= The Freikorps Enter Berlin

From 11 January the Freikorps storm the occupied buildings with artillery and machine guns. Prisoners are shot. Posters across the city call for the murder of Liebknecht and Luxemburg.

- @stay: Luxemburg and Liebknecht stay in Berlin, with the workers.
- @leave: Get them out of Berlin.

@stay
subtitle: The radicals will respect it. The risk is great.
on-arrival: leaders_risk += 25; ultraleft_satisfaction += 5
go-to: fate

@leave
subtitle: Safer, but the Berlin workers will say their leaders ran.
on-arrival: leaders_risk -= 30; unity -= 5; ultraleft_satisfaction -= 5; district_berlin_loyalty -= 5
go-to: fate

@fate
title: 15 January
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.luxemburg_alive = (100 * Math.random() >= Q.leaders_risk) ? 1 : 0;
Q.liebknecht_alive = (100 * Math.random() >= Q.leaders_risk) ? 1 : 0;
if (!Q.luxemburg_alive) {
    Q.luxemburgist_satisfaction -= 10;
    Q.unity -= 5;
}
if (!Q.liebknecht_alive) {
    Q.militancy += 5;
}
if (!Q.luxemburg_alive && !Q.liebknecht_alive) {
    Q.spd_relation -= 15;
    Q.uspd_relation -= 5;
}
Q.spartacist_uprising_done = 1;
!}

= 15 January 1919

[? if luxemburg_alive = 0 and liebknecht_alive = 0 : On the night of 15 January, officers of the Guards Cavalry Rifle Division capture Rosa Luxemburg and Karl Liebknecht. Both are murdered. Luxemburg's body is thrown into the Landwehr Canal. The party has lost its two best-known leaders, and it will never forgive the social democrats who called in the Freikorps. ?]

[? if luxemburg_alive = 1 and liebknecht_alive = 0 : Karl Liebknecht is captured and shot "while trying to escape". Rosa Luxemburg escapes the manhunt. The history of the party, and perhaps of Germany, has changed. ?]

[? if luxemburg_alive = 0 and liebknecht_alive = 1 : Rosa Luxemburg is captured and murdered, and her body is thrown into the Landwehr Canal. Karl Liebknecht escapes the manhunt. ?]

[? if luxemburg_alive = 1 and liebknecht_alive = 1 : The officers who come for Luxemburg and Liebknecht find an empty flat. Both have escaped. The history of the party, and perhaps of Germany, has changed. ?]

The uprising is over. Order prevails in Berlin.
